-earnings/"},{"c":"EPD 2023 Q3","e":"epd","d":"2023-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jim Teague","x":"We felt like that was the right size, given what we see.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/10/31/enterprise-products-partners-epd-q3-2023-earnings/"},{"c":"EPD 2024 Q2","e":"epd","d":"2024-07-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"W. Randall Fowler","x":"Tariffs, export tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/07/30/enterprise-products-partners-epd-q2-2024-earnings/"},{"c":"EPD 2024 Q2","e":"epd","d":"2024-07-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Brent B. Secrest","x":"But in terms of trying to expand anything that they have, especially over in Asia, I think, you know, that makes them pause if they can continue to grow and depend on the U.S. But the tariff side, I mean, I'll just -- I'm going to expand on that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/07/30/enterprise-products-partners-epd-q2-2024-earnings/"},{"c":"EPD 2024 Q4","e":"epd","d":"2025-02-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Justin M. Kleiderer","x":"On the -- when you look at the GOM side, it's one thing to note that while Permian Y-grade rates stay in the reinvestment economic range as we build out Bahia, a lot of what changes associated to Rockies flows and those Rockies tariffs are significantly higher.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/04/enterprise-products-partners-epd-q4-2024-earnings/"},{"c":"EPD 2024 Q4","e":"epd","d":"2025-02-04","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"John Mackay","x":"We've obviously seen a lot of different headlines on the tariff front, we had some kind of retaliatory tariffs from China overnight, I guess.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/04/enterprise-products-partners-epd-q4-2024-earnings/"},{"c":"EPD 2025 Q2","e":"epd","d":"2025-07-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jim Teague","x":"This past quarter was dominated by headline